1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,938
The KGMA result deserves its own arithmetic, because fan-voted awards measure something charts can't: mobilization.

2
00:00:07,938 --> 00:00:20,811
Thirty-three thousand votes in a solo category means fanbases coordinating across time zones, on apps, against other mobilized fanbases — and eighty-five percent of the share means it wasn't close.

3
00:00:20,811 --> 00:00:27,693
For a member whose fandom identity was built during four months of waiting, the vote was the wait, cashed in.

